      "body": "<!-- claude-slack-attribution -->\n_Requested via [Slack thread](https://oplabs-pbc.slack.com/archives/C03N11M0BBN/p1794241666331999)_\n\n## Summary\n\n**Before:** The U21 Sepolia task `115-U21-op-ink-soneium-uni` (OP Sepolia, Ink Sepolia, Soneium Minato, Unichain Sepolia) showed `Status: [READY TO SIGN]`, so it was still treated as pending and picked up by `fetch-tasks.sh` for stacked simulation.\n\n**After:** The task is marked `Status: [EXECUTED](https://sepolia.etherscan.io/tx/0xc6e770ee6cf88566dfef0e7113d5ce4423cdc80f1ee2f090b91e027e652b925b)`, linking the execution transaction.\n\nHow: one-line edit to the README status line; `src/script/check-task-statuses.sh` passes. Docs-only, no config or VALIDATION changes.\n\n---\n\n## For Task PRs\n\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/sep/115-U21-op-ink-soneium-uni`\n\n**Tenderly simulation link**: N/A (status update only, no calldata change)\n\n---\n\n## Additional context\n\n| Task | Execution tx |\n| --- | --- |\n| `sep/115-U21-op-ink-soneium-uni` | [0xc6e770ee…652b925b](https://sepolia.etherscan.io/tx/0xc6e770ee6cf88566dfef0e7113d5ce4423cdc80f1ee2f090b91e027e652b925b) |\n\nThe other U21 Sepolia tasks (122, 123) were already marked EXECUTED. Reviewers: please confirm on Etherscan that the tx is the L1PAO (`0x1Eb2fFc903729a0F03966B917003800b145F56E2`) execution of this task.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01PAqwYKGD9UNVpRCWxgJDTw)_",
